Data derived from CPython and Unicode
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
crates/pyroid-core/src/ftfy/tables.rs and unicode_tables.rs also contain data
extracted from CPython 3.11-3.15 (the html.entities HTML5 entity list, the
single-byte codec tables, and the regex character classes \s, \w and \d of each
CPython's Unicode database). CPython is distributed under the Python Software
Foundation License; the Unicode Character Database is distributed under the
Unicode License v3 (Unicode-3.0).
